 chain'\\nexpresses some 'collagen alpha-1(III) chain'\\n\\n\\n\\n**Your ORCID**\\nhttps://orcid.org/0009-0000-8480-9277\\n\\n**Additional notes or concerns**\\nI will add a link to fibrochondrocyte - 'develops from' some 'fibrochondrocyte progenitor cell' once the term is added\\n\",\n","metadata":{"matches":1,"truncated":false},"title":"Progenitor cell","time":{"start":1778525655795,"end":1778525655834}},"id":"prt_e1863ce8f001IP2uc93zU6JGO2","sessionID":"ses_1e79f1bebffeycTL0mqF9yWRLz","messageID":"msg_e18615a6d001yzczVnc5OS7oKx"}}
